    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You have been trained to use Brewer’s tools, gaining the following benefits:</p><ul><li>Increase your Wisdom or Constitution score by 1, to a maximum of 20.</li><li>You gain proficiency in Brewers tools, or expertise if you were already proficient.</li><li>The time and cost it takes for you to craft alcohol is halved.</li><li>All alcoholic drinks you make grant a number of temporary hit points to the drinker equal to twice your proficiency bonus.</li></ul>",
